# PlingPeat / STUDIO-OS environment — copy to `.env` and fill in.
# SELF-CONTAINED: this project does NOT read BRAINDEAD/.env or any sibling project.
# All tools in tools/ load only THIS .env. Only interior-design-relevant AI keys live here;
# BRAINDEAD's crypto/finance keys (AWS, R2, CoinDesk, Databento, Dune, CryptoQuant, Telegram)
# are deliberately NOT copied.
#
# `.env` (real keys) is gitignored; `.env.example` (this file, placeholders) is committed.

# --- Gemini (Google AI Studio) --------------------------------------------------------------
# Powers: tools/gemini_dr.py (deep research w/ Google Search + 32k thinking) and
#         tools/gemini_image.py (Nano-Banana photoreal render pass).
# Get a key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# --- OpenAI (platform API — NOT the ChatGPT Plus subscription) -------------------------------
# Powers: tools/chatgpt_dr.py (GPT-5 research + o4-mini agentic deep-research).
# NOTE: a ChatGPT Plus sub does NOT include API credits — this bills per-token via this key.
# Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Perplexity (independent search index) ---------------------------------------------------
# Powers: tools/perplexity_dr.py (sonar-pro / sonar-reasoning-pro). Pay-per-use, no daily limit.
# Get a key at https://www.perplexity.ai/settings/api
PERPLEXITY_API_KEY=

# --- Anthropic (OPTIONAL) --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not needed for the tools above (Claude Code already provides Claude). Only fill this if you
# later add a standalone Python script that calls the Claude API directly.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Blendkit (formerly BlenderKit) — Full plan, ONE-MONTH trial ------------------------------
# Owner order 2026-08-22 (ORD-2026-08-22-blenderkit-one-month) · the action is ASK-031.
# Powers: pipeline/scripts/blenderkit.py (fetch full-plan models by asset id -> .blend ->
#         GLB via headless Blender -> scale-asserted shelf at assets/shared/blenderkit, gitignored).
# Subscribe at https://www.blendkit.com/plans/pricing — Full card, the '30 day glimpse' tab ($19.90, non-recurring;
# the page opens on the Yearly tab showing $9.90/mo, which is $118.80/yr) — then copy the key
# from https://www.blendkit.com/profile
BLENDERKIT_API_KEY=
